OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry and partly cloudy. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will be dry with
OL,8,Fvariable amounts of cloud. Frost and
OL,9,Ffog where skies remain clear.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FMainly dry although rather
OL,12,Fcloudy at times. Chance of one or two
OL,13,Flight showers, mainly across
OL,14,FLanarkshire and Greater Glasgow.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,17,Fsettled although rather cloudy at
OL,18,Ftimes. Chance of one or two light
OL,19,Fshowers in the east. Light winds.
